==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-beforehand.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# At an [[earlier]] or [[preceding]] [[time]].
#: ''Will it be possible to have access to the room '''beforehand''' so that we can set up chairs?''

====Antonyms====
* [[afterwards]]

====Synonyms====
* [[in advance]]

